{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","title":"prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1767,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-unit-normal-field]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:frame-neg-member]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-neg-member]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:existence-orthonormal-frames]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","line":2918,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[The Induced Orientation is Smooth]\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-orientation, def:smooth-unit-normal-field, def:smooth-orientation, lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth, lem:frame-neg-member, lem:normal-restrict-neg-member, lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation, prop:existence-orthonormal-frames, def:interior-multiplication, lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis, lem:induced-orientation-characterization}\n\n\n\n\nIf $n\\ge1$ and an immersion $F:M^n\\to\\widetilde M^{n+1}$ into an oriented Riemannian manifold has a smooth global unit normal, then the induced orientation of $M$ is smooth; in particular $M$ is orientable.\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-orientation,lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth,lem:frame-neg-member,lem:normal-restrict-neg-member,lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation,prop:existence-orthonormal-frames}\n\\sketch On a neighbourhood choose a smooth orthonormal frame $(E_i)$ and let $s(x)$ be the contracted ambient volume form evaluated on it. Lemma \\ref{lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth} makes $s$ continuous and it never vanishes. On the region where $s>0$ the frame is positively oriented; where $s<0$, negate one member using Lemmas \\ref{lem:frame-neg-member} and \\ref{lem:normal-restrict-neg-member}. These local frames prove smoothness.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[The Induced Orientation is Smooth] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a6879706572737572666163652d6f7269656e7461626c652d6f662d6e6f726d616c\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-orientation\">↗ def:induced-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-unit-normal-field\">↗ def:smooth-unit-normal-field</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-orientation\">↗ def:smooth-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-restrict-frame-smooth\">↗ lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aframe-neg-member\">↗ lem:frame-neg-member</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-restrict-neg-member\">↗ lem:normal-restrict-neg-member</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anonvanishing-top-form-orientation\">↗ lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aexistence-orthonormal-frames\">↗ prop:existence-orthonormal-frames</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainterior-multiplication\">↗ def:interior-multiplication</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aadapted-frame-ambient-basis\">↗ lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Ainduced-orientation-characterization\">↗ lem:induced-orientation-characterization</a> <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n\\ge 1$\">$n\\ge 1$</span> and an immersion <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F:M^n\\to \\widetilde M^{n+1}$\">$F:M^n\\to \\widetilde M^{n+1}$</span> into an oriented Riemannian manifold has a smooth global unit normal, then the induced orientation of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> is smooth; in particular <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> is orientable.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainduced-orientation\">↗ def:induced-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-restrict-frame-smooth\">↗ lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aframe-neg-member\">↗ lem:frame-neg-member</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-restrict-neg-member\">↗ lem:normal-restrict-neg-member</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anonvanishing-top-form-orientation\">↗ lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23prop%3Aexistence-orthonormal-frames\">↗ prop:existence-orthonormal-frames</a> \\sketch On a neighbourhood choose a smooth orthonormal frame <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(E_i)$\">$(E_i)$</span> and let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$s(x)$\">$s(x)$</span> be the contracted ambient volume form evaluated on it. Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-restrict-frame-smooth\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6e6f726d616c2d72657374726963742d6672616d652d736d6f6f7468\">8</a> makes <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$s$\">$s$</span> continuous and it never vanishes. On the region where <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$s&gt;0$\">$s&gt;0$</span> the frame is positively oriented; where <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$s&lt;0$\">$s&lt;0$</span>, negate one member using Lemmas <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aframe-neg-member\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:frame-neg-member\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6672616d652d6e65672d6d656d626572\">8</a> and <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anormal-restrict-neg-member\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-neg-member\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6e6f726d616c2d72657374726963742d6e65672d6d656d626572\">8</a>. These local frames prove smoothness. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-neg-member","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#rem:hypersurface-orientation-dimension","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","label":"def:induced-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-unit-normal-field","title":"def:smooth-unit-normal-field","label":"def:smooth-unit-normal-field"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation","title":"def:smooth-orientation","label":"def:smooth-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","title":"lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","label":"lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:frame-neg-member","title":"lem:frame-neg-member","label":"lem:frame-neg-member"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-neg-member","title":"lem:normal-restrict-neg-member","label":"lem:normal-restrict-neg-member"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","title":"lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","label":"lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:existence-orthonormal-frames","title":"prop:existence-orthonormal-frames","label":"prop:existence-orthonormal-frames"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","label":"def:interior-multiplication"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis","title":"lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis","label":"lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization","title":"lem:induced-orientation-characterization","label":"lem:induced-orientation-characterization"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#rem:hypersurface-orientation-dimension","title":"rem:hypersurface-orientation-dimension","label":"rem:hypersurface-orientation-dimension"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form-if"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-volume-form","title":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form","label":"prop:hypersurface-volume-form"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","title":"prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal","tex":"\\begin{proposition}[The Induced Orientation is Smooth]\n\\label{prop:hypersurface-orientable-of-normal}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-orientation, def:smooth-unit-normal-field, def:smooth-orientation, lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth, lem:frame-neg-member, lem:normal-restrict-neg-member, lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation, prop:existence-orthonormal-frames, def:interior-multiplication, lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis, lem:induced-orientation-characterization}\n\n\n\n\nIf $n\\ge1$ and an immersion $F:M^n\\to\\widetilde M^{n+1}$ into an oriented Riemannian manifold has a smooth global unit normal, then the induced orientation of $M$ is smooth; in particular $M$ is orientable.\n\\end{proposition}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{def:induced-orientation,lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth,lem:frame-neg-member,lem:normal-restrict-neg-member,lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation,prop:existence-orthonormal-frames}\n\\sketch On a neighbourhood choose a smooth orthonormal frame $(E_i)$ and let $s(x)$ be the contracted ambient volume form evaluated on it. Lemma \\ref{lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth} makes $s$ continuous and it never vanishes. On the region where $s>0$ the frame is positively oriented; where $s<0$, negate one member using Lemmas \\ref{lem:frame-neg-member} and \\ref{lem:normal-restrict-neg-member}. These local frames prove smoothness.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-unit-normal-field","title":"def:smooth-unit-normal-field","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation","title":"def:smooth-orientation","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","title":"lem:normal-restrict-frame-smooth","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:frame-neg-member","title":"lem:frame-neg-member","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:normal-restrict-neg-member","title":"lem:normal-restrict-neg-member","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","title":"lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:existence-orthonormal-frames","title":"prop:existence-orthonormal-frames","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis","title":"lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization","title":"lem:induced-orientation-characterization","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}